Subject: Share the original frontend camera animation catalog with native loading

Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Move the unchanged 37 filename/alias entries into one shared initializer and
share their original record type. The console factory retains its existing
local array, ordering, literals and request loop. Native port code can consume
the same immutable initializer with host array lengths.
The complete factory, filters, gameplay camera and global registry stay unselected.

Refreshed for decomp 9046e67a: src/Game/Camera/CameraMan.cpp keeps its upstream
text (patch 0195 restored it anyway).

diff --git a/include/Game/Camera/FrontendCameraCatalog.h b/include/Game/Camera/FrontendCameraCatalog.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b31609f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/include/Game/Camera/FrontendCameraCatalog.h
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+#ifndef _FRONTENDCAMERACATALOG_H_
+#define _FRONTENDCAMERACATALOG_H_
+
+struct CameraAnimationLoadInfo
+{
+    const char* fileName;
+    const char* animationName;
+};
+
+#endif
